#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This generic group provides the following:
#
#- Camera sensor setup
#- Ego vehicle front bumper boundary available for moving object detection
#- AEB control logic and tuning parameters
#*AEB is set to Off for this generic group, though the AEB logic exists within
#- Other parameters necessary for the Pedestrian Euro NCAP testing Events
#
#*To apply AEB, set the AEB_On output to 1 in the FCW-AEB VS Commands within the vehicle Sensor Setup (note: for optimized AEB tuning, see the AEB CPNA_25 example)
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

